From 6b3ec3db0015f70518c7e6370f3317c1b4753902 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bb-machine <ubuntu@bb-machine>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:59:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(admission): honor explicit queued delivery mode

Carry the owning explicit queue action through frozen native admission without rewriting accepted semantic intent. Preserve automatic queue behavior, historical targets, schedules, claims and execution ceilings.
---
